    "Results start hidden behind a painting. Press and hold one to reveal or hide it, then tap to open it." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding page 2 body",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Els resultats apareixen amagats darrere d’una pintura. Mantén premut un per mostrar-lo o amagar-lo i, després, toca’l per obrir-lo."
          }
        },
        "eu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Emaitzak margolan baten atzean ezkutatuta agertzen dira. Eduki sakatuta bat erakusteko edo ezkutatzeko, eta gero ukitu irekitzeko."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Results stay hidden until you press and hold them. Turn it off to see them as soon as you open the app." : {
